# onomatron

Generate **names of characters from French literature** with a from-scratch
character-level language model (makemore-style), served from
[{{ model_repo }}](https://huggingface.co/{{ model_repo }}).

The Space loads the model repo set in the `ONOMATRON_MODEL_REPO` variable
(published by `scripts/publish_hf.py --mode push`). Pick a seed to reproduce a
generation exactly.
